  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vocational skills training for 10 Afghan widows</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project provides three-month vocational tailoring and small business skills training for ten Afghan widows, who are some of the most vulnerable in Afghanistan, often supporting large families and other orphaned children. On successful completion, the women receive a sewing machine and other basics to commence their own tailoring business at home in order to be able to support their children. Training is provided by female tailor-trainers.</narrative>
  </description>
